    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/e08b9d0153b5e45cfc56777f448fbf5a.avif?t=1753951737\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/2249c6102bc46b88367a05eecfc9229d.poster.avif?t=1753951737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/2249c6102bc46b88367a05eecfc9229d.webm?t=1753951737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/2249c6102bc46b88367a05eecfc9229d.mp4?t=1753951737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a nonlinear exploration adventure filled with corrupted replicants,  robot uprising, brutal warmachines and more. Guide a lone replicant from a war-torn metropolis through desert, forest and sea as you unveil the secrets of this cryptic world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300b<i>Explore</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300b<i>Fight</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300b<i>Solve Puzzles</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300b<i>Upgrade Your Abilities</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300b<i>C</i>ontrol Forgotten Vehicles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the lore of a ruined dystopian world by observing the environment, colors and body language.  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/e08b9d0153b5e45cfc56777f448fbf5a.avif?t=1753951737\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/2249c6102bc46b88367a05eecfc9229d.poster.avif?t=1753951737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/2249c6102bc46b88367a05eecfc9229d.webm?t=1753951737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/2249c6102bc46b88367a05eecfc9229d.mp4?t=1753951737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a nonlinear exploration adventure filled with corrupted replicants,  robot uprising, brutal warmachines and more. Guide a lone replicant from a war-torn metropolis through desert, forest and sea as you unveil the secrets of this cryptic world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300b<i>Explore</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300b<i>Fight</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300b<i>Solve Puzzles</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300b<i>Upgrade Your Abilities</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300b<i>C</i>ontrol Forgotten Vehicles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the lore of a ruined dystopian world by observing the environment, colors and body language.  </p>",
    "short_description": "A cryptic and atmospheric journey of foggy wastelands, abandoned machinery and robot kinship.",
